# Google Maps basemap (optional). Without a key the map uses a free OpenFreeMap basemap styled like Google Maps.
# 1. https://console.cloud.google.com/ → create a project and attach a billing account
# 2. APIs & Services → Library → enable "Map Tiles API"
# 3. Credentials → Create API key → restrict it to the Map Tiles API and your site's URLs
# Free allowance: 100,000 2D tile requests per month.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
